{"decisions":[{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Every rating is a multiplier against an ordinary hour."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Two activities differing only in how those activities reach Alan are rated apart."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Every rating is on a quarter-step scale from a quarter to two."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"The number ordering the activities is no rating."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The multiplier is the fourteen ratings multiplied together."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Reality counts a whole for authentic and a half for professional and a quarter for celebrity."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Safety counts a quarter at L3 and a half at L4 and three quarters at L5 and a whole at L6."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Modality adds a half for presence."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Modality adds a quarter for audio."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Modality adds 0.15 for digital presence."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Modality adds 0.15 for text."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Modality adds 0.1 for image."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An hour of an activity meets the multiplier over thirty-two of his connection need."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"It is parasocial where the other person is not authentic."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"Nothing worked out from the ratings is stored."}]}
